// 26383 THE OTHER HALF OF 51, AND WHY IT STAYS AN ARM. The absolute-NDC
// branch below the passthrough gate carries khaD *= (1 - 1e-4), a uniform
// depth BIAS, and 26363/26364 spent a campaign removing the last bias this
// file carried; the absolute form also costs 26184's precision on the
// terrain pull and the far-keep offsets. 51 selects it with the recompute
// default; 203 selects it with the passthrough restored, a combination
// 26381 had no way to reach.
// Neither is a fold candidate. If a seam ever returns and ONLY this half
