// paintPath2Runs is the companion: the 2->1 direction, where a stale late
// paint coexists with the next frame's fresh early paint. That is the same
// one-frame cross-frame double the 26163 carry was rejected for, and it has
// ALWAYS shipped in the default at this rate without ever being reported.
// It does not overturn 26163 - what 26163 measured was a PERMANENT double,
