// with the duplicate present, so this is one paint, not two). First fire =
// good epoch, no verification. Last fire = verified, bad epoch.
// The fire to keep is therefore neither: it is the EARLIEST fire that is
// already sweep-verified - the oldest epoch that can still clear the near
// floor. The learned last index stays only as a backstop, so a frame whose
