// extra zero-strength-free draw on static frames.
// 26170: FALSIFIED BEFORE IT EVER SHIPPED, by the trace it was built from.
// The gate was written without checking WHICH frames carry. They are the
// path-1 frame of each 1->2 transition, and every one on record is moving:
