// only quantity the artifact is a function of. 26265's own dumps make the point:
// engCopies tracked svInjects perfectly while the copy was landing a translated
// matrix, because "the copy happened" and "the copy was right" were never
// separated. Method note 4, one level up.
//
// So the copy's DESTINATION is staged back and gated next frame. One frame late
// is exactly right here - this is a statistic, not a value: the live decision
